  "observations": [
    "Original ON_UserString read/write uses nested anonymous1.0 chunks and two wide strings.",
    "Original wide string reader reads element count then sets length to n-1; final code unit is not required to be zero. Windows raw UTF16 code units are retained.",
    "Original EndRead3dmChunk increments the archive CRC error count and reports mismatch independently of its bool. Partial chunk data may skip CRC and seek beyond buffer.",
    "Original conversion runtime ignores virtual reader false and retains partial decoded data; managed safety limits instead throw before replacing opaque data."
